direction: down
title: "LOCAL RETURN IS NOT CLEAN TARGET REUSE\nProposed sufficient contract, conditional on complete producer admission"
title.shape: text
track: "Track BEFORE each callout\nSigned leases / root debt; tagged aux / activation\nExecEnv + runner root + in-flight callback\nTail slot / list + actual native / Gambit root custody"
branch: "Invocation outcome"
branch.shape: diamond
suspend: "SuspensionReceipt\nOwned live activation / environment / offset\nSession can retain this state; no clean epoch inferred"
local: "InvocationReturnReceipt\nActual native runner returned; expected caller restored\nLocal depth / result / borrowed resources balanced"
close: "Control owner checks clean-epoch closure\nNo old native trace / future snapshot / callback\nDebt and deferred reservations discharged\nTail / injected / result / resource work drained\nCancel / async / event / hook producer set closed"
decide: "All boundary predicates proved for admitted domain?"
decide.shape: diamond
refuse: "Unknown producer / persistent shared coroutine\nReject clean reuse, retain custody / session semantics\nNever delete application state just to empty the guard"
publish: "Preserve source reset observations\nOwned reset postconditions + result delivery settled\nPublish ReusableReceipt and next epoch atomically\nNo producer admission window"
status: "Current study: no native reusable profile issued\nModern generated C and Zig need same protocol\n0 paths retired; Zig incremental net benefit unresolved"
track -> branch
branch -> suspend: "yield"
branch -> local: "native return"
local -> close -> decide
suspend -> refuse
decide -> refuse: "no"
decide -> publish: "yes"
publish -> status
refuse -> status
suspend.style.fill: "#DFEEFF"
refuse.style.fill: "#FFF0E5"
publish.style.fill: "#E8F4E8"
